Copyright 2026 Chen Xiaodong

This product includes substantial modifications of the educational
paper-ai-agent prototype originally authored by zxTinF. Publication of this
version is made with the original author's permission.

The current version replaces the prototype runtime and application flow with
an AgentScope-based runtime boundary, evidence snapshots, stage-gated writing
workflows, immutable outline/section/document versions, structured citations,
and PostgreSQL/Flyway persistence.
